Create new work items in the backlog.",description:"Conversation starter shown in Rovo Chat on Jira backlog that asks Rovo to create new issues in the backlog."},jiraBacklogPrompt7:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.conversation-starters.jira-backlog.starter-7",defaultMessage:"Move a set of work items in this backlog to the upcoming sprint.",description:"Conversation starter shown in Rovo Chat on Jira backlog that asks Rovo to move a set of work items in the backlog into the next sprint."},jiraBacklogPrompt8:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.conversation-starters.jira-backlog.starter-8",defaultMessage:"Write a description for a `Jira work item`.",description:"Conversation starter shown in Rovo Chat on Jira backlog that asks Rovo to write a description for a backlog item. The phrase `Jira work item` inside backticks is a link placeholder — the user replaces it in the chat editor with a specific issue via the link/mention typeahead (e.g. TREX-586) before sending. Do not translate the backticks or the placeholder token `Jira work item`."},jiraBacklogPrompt9:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.conversation-starters.jira-backlog.starter-9",defaultMessage:"Update the summary for a set of work items in this backlog.",description:"Conversation starter shown in Rovo Chat on Jira backlog that asks Rovo to update the summary/title of a set of work items in the backlog."},jiraBacklogPrompt10:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.conversation-starters.jira-backlog.starter-10",defaultMessage:"Update the priority of a set of work items in this backlog to `priority`.",description:'Conversation starter shown in Rovo Chat on Jira backlog that asks Rovo to update the priority of a set of work items in the backlog. The word `priority` inside backticks is a free-text placeholder — the user replaces it in the chat editor with a specific priority (e.g. "High", "Medium", "Low") before sending. Do not translate the backticks or the placeholder token `priority`.'},jiraBacklogPrompt11:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.conversation-starters.jira-backlog.starter-11",defaultMessage:"Update the parent for a set of work items in this backlog.",description:"Conversation starter shown in Rovo Chat on Jira backlog that asks Rovo to update the parent issue of work items in this backlog."},jiraBacklogPrompt12:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.conversation-starters.jira-backlog.starter-12",defaultMessage:"Are there any Jira issues not connected to a parent issue?",description:"Conversation starter shown in Rovo Chat on Jira backlog that asks Rovo to find orphaned items with no parent."},jiraBacklogPrompt13:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.conversation-starters.jira-backlog.starter-13",defaultMessage:"Which work items are stale in the backlog?",description:"Conversation starter shown in Rovo Chat on Jira backlog that asks Rovo to identify items that have not been updated recently."},jiraBacklogPrompt14:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.conversation-starters.jira-backlog.starter-14",defaultMessage:"What issues don't have an estimate in the backlog?",description:"Conversation starter shown in Rovo Chat on Jira backlog that asks Rovo to find unestimated items."},jiraBacklogPrompt15:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.conversation-starters.jira-backlog.starter-15",defaultMessage:"Are there any blocked issues in the backlog?",description:"Conversation starter shown in Rovo Chat on Jira backlog that asks Rovo to find items marked as blocked."},jsmIncidentViewPrompt1:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.conversation-starters.jsm-incident-view.starter-1",defaultMessage:"Find people who can help resolve this incident",description:"The first prompt option in the empty state of the chat history when viewing a JSM incident"},jsmIncidentViewPrompt2:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.conversation-starters.jsm-incident-view.starter-2",defaultMessage:"Are there any ongoing incidents?",description:"The second prompt option in the empty state of the chat history when viewing a JSM incident"},jsmIncidentViewPrompt3:{id:"rovo-co